      {
       "text": "Corrected an incorrect audio file.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Steam achievements not triggering properly.: Thank you for your support and for taking the time to share your reports. Please let us know if you encounter any further issues in the game.: Best regards,: SoftSource & Berangin Creative Team",
